---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---

<PageLayout title="Ownership & funding" intro={`Who is behind ${SITE.name}, and how it is paid for.`}>
  <h2>Who publishes this site</h2>
  <p>
    {SITE.name} is published by {SITE.publisher.name}, {SITE.publisher.address}.
    {SITE.companyNumber && <> Registered in England and Wales, company no. {SITE.companyNumber}.</>}
    {SITE.registeredOffice && <> Registered office: {SITE.registeredOffice}.</>}
  </p>

  <h2>Businesses connected to our publisher</h2>
  <p>
    Some articles feature businesses connected to our publisher. Every one of those articles carries a disclosure at the
    top naming the business, so you know about the connection before you read it.
  </p>

  <h2>How we are funded</h2>
  <p>
    The site is funded by its publisher. We don't charge readers, and there is no paywall. If we take paid advertising,
    sponsorship or affiliate commission in future, it will be labelled on the page where it appears, as set out in our
    <a href="/editorial-policy/">editorial policy</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>Email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
</PageLayout>
